\section{Conclusion}\label{sec:conclusion}
This paper presented an Adaptive FedProx module that addresses the dual challenges of non-IID data and straggler clients in federated learning. By dynamically tuning the proximal parameter $\mu$, we achieved a 0.8947 improvement in resilience metrics. Future work will explore theoretical convergence bounds for dynamic $\mu$ under asynchronous updates.

